# SPA fallback — Netlify, Cloudflare Pages and Render static sites.
#
# React Router owns every path after the domain, but those paths are not files.
# Without this line a host asked for /tools looks for dist/tools, finds nothing
# and serves its 404 page — which is why a refresh or a restored tab breaks
# while typing the bare domain works. 200 (not 301) so the URL is preserved and
# the router still sees the original path.
/*  /index.html  200
